  "/llms.txt": { type: "text/plain; charset=utf-8", body: "# Accessibility Checker\n\n> Free WCAG 2.1 + 2.2 accessibility scanner. Scan a page or a whole site;\n> Pro adds rendered scans, daily monitoring with score-drop alerts, and\n> emailed reports. 14-day free trial.\n\n- Site: https://checker.lazynext.com/\n- API: https://checker.lazynext.com (same-origin — POST /scan, GET /report/:id, GET /badge/:id.svg, GET /rules, POST /lead, GET /checkout, POST /cancel, GET|POST|DELETE /monitor)\n- OpenAPI: https://checker.lazynext.com/openapi.json\n- Coverage catalog (HTML): https://checker.lazynext.com/rules with Accept: text/html\n- Built by: https://lazynext.com\n" },
